      "font_size": 9.96,
      "font_name": "SFTI1000",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 820,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24807_p12_b12",
      "text": "Train-test prompt alignment and dense similarity prompting. Using similar-\nity maps as dense mask prompts provides additional spatial conditioning be-\nyond point prompts (78.3\u219277.6). More importantly, training with CLIP-sampled\npoints significantly improves robustness: models trained on GT points but eval-\nuated on CLIP prompts drop sharply (78.3\u219269.8), supporting our strategy of\ntraining with noisy prompts for text-only inference.\n",
